option.EXPOSURE=Exposure
option.EXPOSURE.comment=Scene brightness in linear light, applied before the tonemap.
option.TONEMAP_ACES=Filmic Tonemap
option.TONEMAP_ACES.comment=ACES filmic curve. Off clamps instead — flatter, more vanilla.
option.VELVET_GRADE=Velvet Grade
option.VELVET_GRADE.comment=Wine-tinted shadows, pearl highlights — the EwoClient identity grade.
option.VIGNETTE_STRENGTH=Vignette
option.VIGNETTE_STRENGTH.comment=Corner darkening, shaped like the launcher backdrop.
option.BLOOM=Bloom
option.BLOOM.comment=Pearl-warmed glow around bright pixels — torches, sun, glowstone.
option.BLOOM_STRENGTH=Bloom Strength
option.BLOOM_STRENGTH.comment=How much glow is added back into the scene.
option.BLOOM_THRESHOLD=Bloom Threshold
option.BLOOM_THRESHOLD.comment=Brightness a pixel needs before it starts glowing.
option.BLOOM_RADIUS=Bloom Radius
option.BLOOM_RADIUS.comment=How far the glow spreads.
option.SHADOWS=Shadows
option.SHADOWS.comment=Sun and moon shadows with soft edges.
option.SHADOW_SOFTNESS=Shadow Softness
option.SHADOW_SOFTNESS.comment=How soft shadow edges are.
option.SHADOW_DARKNESS=Shadow Depth
option.SHADOW_DARKNESS.comment=How dark full shadow gets — shadowed light leans wine, not grey.
option.shadowMapResolution=Shadow Quality
option.shadowMapResolution.comment=Shadow map resolution. Higher = crisper, costlier.
option.VOLUMETRIC_LIGHT=Light Shafts
option.VOLUMETRIC_LIGHT.comment=Sun and moon rays through fog and foliage.
option.VL_STRENGTH=Shaft Intensity
option.VL_STRENGTH.comment=How strong the light shafts glow.
option.VL_STEPS=Shaft Quality
option.VL_STEPS.comment=Raymarch steps — higher is smoother and costlier.
option.WATER_WAVES=Water Waves
option.WATER_WAVES.comment=Animated water surface with ripple shading and a teal depth tint.
option.WATER_FOAM=Shore Foam
option.WATER_FOAM.comment=Pearl foam line where water meets land.
option.WATER_SSR=Water Reflections
option.WATER_SSR.comment=Real reflections on water — the world mirrored, sky where the mirror can't reach.
option.SSR_STRENGTH=Reflection Strength
option.SSR_STRENGTH.comment=How strongly the water mirrors.
option.VELVET_SKY=Velvet Sky
option.VELVET_SKY.comment=Custom sky gradient with ember-rose sunsets and pearl stars.
option.VELVET_FOG=Atmospheric Fog
option.VELVET_FOG.comment=Distance dissolves into the sky instead of a hard fog wall.
option.FOG_DISTANCE=Fog Distance
option.FOG_DISTANCE.comment=How far away the atmosphere takes over.
